  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Process consultant for renovation of the Karen Blixen Museum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The renovation of the Karen Blixen Museum in Nairobi will be a major undertaking in close collaboration with the Government of Kenya, specifically the Ministry of Culture and the National Museums of Kenya. 10M DKK has so far been committed for the project, and in order to make a realistic plan for disbursement the Embassy wishes to hire a process consultant to carry out the following tasks:
- assess the in-house capacity of the National Museums of Kenya in the field of Architecture and renovation
- conduct a light stakeholder mapping
- advise on best possible way forward taking into account the minister&apos;s approval of the project and its scope, as well as the government of Kenya&apos;s wishes, capacities and commitment
- possibly draft tender material for an EU tender and act as tender consultant for a possible tender for the 10M DKK (unclear whether it should be one or two separate contracts)</narrative>
  </description>
